      "findings": [
        {
          "severity": "Major",
          "kind": "important_source_use_omitted",
          "reason": "Source sense s001 '进口' has unresolved POS; evidence (Collins import:n explicitly includes 'the action of bringing goods from abroad') supports a noun activity meaning. Candidate includes verb '进口' and noun '进口货物/进口品', but omits the noun activity '进口（行为/活动）'. This conflates activity noun with verb and leaves a common noun use uncovered.",
