          ],
          "source_sense_ids": [
            "s001"
          ],
          "candidate_group_ref": "core",
          "proposed_fix": "Add a core noun group: ['进口；输入（行为/活动）', 名词, [s001], [pub:p6c5:collins:import:n], '从国外买入或运入货物的行为/过程'] or explicitly hold s001 noun activity as unresolved."
        },
        {
          "severity": "Info",
          "kind": "unresolved_evidence",
          "reason": "Source sense s002 '输入' also has unresolved POS and may include a noun meaning (input content/quantity), but no explicit noun evidence is supplied. Candidate flags this as Minor coverage_gap and does not include a noun group. This is acceptable as an unresolved gap, not a confirmed error.",
