          "kind": "unresolved_evidence",
          "reason": "Source POS for all three senses is unresolved. Candidate covers obvious verb/noun splits for 'support/支持' and 'support/支撑', but noun uses for s002 '支撑' (physical prop) and s003 '供养' (financial means/act) are not included as core; candidate lists '支撑物/支柱' as external addition. This may be acceptable, but source not explicitly limited to verbs.",
