      ],
      "preferences": [
        "Core count 4 exceeds typical 3 but is justified by distinct verb/noun and physical/financial meanings; consider grouping 'support' financial provision under same verb as already done."
      ],
      "note": "Candidate appropriately separates moral support (verb/noun), physical support, and financial support. No confirmed translation or POS error. Ambiguity from unresolved source POS is acknowledged and mostly handled through additions and flags; no correction required."
